# Roasted Shrimp Tacos

Based on [http://www.howsweeteats.com/…](http://www.howsweeteats.com/2023/11/roasted-shrimp-tacos/)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 lb [raw jumbo shrimp]{ ing="raw-jumbo-shrimp" }, peeled and deveined
- [ ] 2 Tbsps [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }, divided
- [ ] 1 tsp [smoked paprika]{ ing="smoked-paprika" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [garlic powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }
- [ ] [Kosher salt and pepper]{ ing="kosher-salt-and-pepper" }
- [ ] 1/2 [green cabbage]{ ing="green-cabbage" }, thinly sliced
- [ ] 1/2 cup [chopped cilantro]{ ing="chopped-cilantro" }, plus more for topping
- [ ] 2 Tbsps freshly [squeezed lime juice]{ ing="squeezed-lime-juice" }
- [ ] 1 cup [corn]{ ing="corn" }
- [ ] 12 4[-inch flour]{ ing="inch-flour" } or corn tortillas
- [ ] [Pickled onions]{ ing="pickled-onions" }, for topping
- [ ] [Cotija cheese]{ ing="cotija-cheese" }, for topping

## Recipe

1. Heat oven to 400°F
1. Combine [shrimp]{ ing="raw-jumbo-shrimp" } with 1 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } in a bowl. Season with [smoked paprika]{ ing="smoked-paprika" }, [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }, [garlic powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }, salt, [and pepper]{ ing="kosher-salt-and-pepper" }. Spread on a sheet pan and roast for 10 minutes
1. While [shrimp]{ ing="raw-jumbo-shrimp" } roasts, prepare slaw by mixing [cabbage]{ ing="green-cabbage" }, [cilantro]{ ing="chopped-cilantro" }, [lime juice]{ ing="squeezed-lime-juice" }, remaining 1 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }, salt, [and pepper]{ ing="kosher-salt-and-pepper" }
1. Add [corn]{ ing="corn" } to the pan with [shrimp]{ ing="raw-jumbo-shrimp" }. Roast another 5-6 minutes
1. Serve on tortillas topped with slaw, [pickled onions]{ ing="pickled-onions" }, [shrimp]{ ing="raw-jumbo-shrimp" }, [corn]{ ing="corn" }, and [cotija cheese]{ ing="cotija-cheese" }
